      "side": 1,
      "message": "An alternative implementation would be to move this to a post-deps mutator, use VisitDirectDepsWithTag to visit the base module, and then type assert it to an interface with SetOverrides(name string, cert, manifest *string).  The implementation of that interface on android_app and apex would stash those values in properties that would be checked in the GenerateAndroidBuildActions implementations.  It would avoid having to use the untyped sync.Maps to store everything.",
